1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 23=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,119
Uncle Zhao.

7
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,440
Brother Zhao.

8
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:56,720
What brings you here, Jinqi?

9
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:01,960
I arranged to watch
Furong's performance with friends.

10
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,598
We'd barely spoken a few words
when Furong was taken away.

11
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,759
They said

12
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:07,999
a distinguished guest
had lost something important,

13
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,600
so the entire troupe had to be searched.

14
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,639
So it's Uncle Zhao and Brother Zhao.

15
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,799
My apologies.

16
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,239
Furong and the other performers

17
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,840
need to cooperate with our questioning.

18
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:20,959
They can't see any visitors.

19
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,680
Hold out both hands.

20
00:02:28,936 --> 00:02:31,210
(The index finger on
the deposed Crown Prince's left hand)

21
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:33,190
(is half a joint longer
than his middle finger,)

22
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,376
(making it unusually long.)

23
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:37,638
These soldiers
aren't exactly meticulous.

24
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:39,718
When it comes
to searching for lost items,

25
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:42,400
the Five City Patrol Office
is better suited to the task.

26
00:02:42,616 --> 00:02:43,510
Why not send someone...

27
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:46,000
I appreciate the offer, Jinqi.

28
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:48,559
We've already brought in enough men.

29
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,392
There's no need
to trouble the Patrol Office.

30
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,399
Once you two finish
over there, come with me.

31
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,759
May I ask what you've lost, Uncle Zhao?

32
00:02:54,888 --> 00:02:56,152
I've had some experience

33
00:02:56,184 --> 00:02:58,510
investigating cases
and finding missing items.

34
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,478
I'd be glad to help.

35
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,519
No need.

36
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,638
It's only a family matter.

37
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:04,280
There's no need to trouble you, Jinqi.

38
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,680
Forgive my presumption.

39
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,598
I forgot to introduce them.

40
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:15,799
This is Scholar Han.

41
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,840
He's currently studying at Qixia Academy

42
00:03:17,879 --> 00:03:19,600
under Scholar Shouyi.

43
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,400
Greetings, Judicial Officer Zhao.

44
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,079
And this

45
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:29,038
is Mister Jia,

46
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:30,759
from Kunshan, Suzhou.

47
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,759
Uncle Zhao,

48
00:03:32,792 --> 00:03:33,950
if you enjoy Kunshan opera...

49
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,320
You have guests, Jinqi.

50
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,039
You should attend to them.

51
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:38,470
There's nothing particularly urgent

52
00:03:38,479 --> 00:03:39,878
I need to attend to.

53
00:03:39,879 --> 00:03:41,799
What are you still standing there for?

54
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:44,160
Hurry and see Jinqi out.

55
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,039
Jinqi,

56
00:03:46,199 --> 00:03:47,320
this way, please.

57
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,120
I'll take my leave.

58
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,479
Please.

59
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:04,639
Hold out your hand.

60
00:04:05,479 --> 00:04:07,759
I still have matters to attend to,
so I won't see you out.

61
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:17,959
I thought they'd question us at length.

62
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:19,399
But instead,

63
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:21,560
they escorted us straight out.

64
00:04:21,879 --> 00:04:25,199
They seemed afraid Commander Lin
might stay even a moment longer.

65
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:27,440
What exactly are they looking for?

66
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,759
How would I know?

67
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,719
This way, please.

68
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,959
Uncle Liu, come here.

69
00:05:08,860 --> 00:05:14,838
(Sanjue Hall)

70
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:16,000
Did you get a good look?

71
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,398
I did.

72
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:21,999
Find a body of similar build
at the public burial ground.

73
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,119
Use it as a decoy

74
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,959
to throw Zhao Xuede off the trail.

75
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,519
Yes.

76
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:42,240
Make the nose a little rounder.

77
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:50,440
Will this do?

78
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:51,638
Yes.

79
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:54,159
Make this earlobe a little bigger.

80
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:02,398
Yesterday,

81
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:04,290
when he was moving
costumes with Young Lady Xu,

82
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:05,318
he brushed past me.

83
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:07,320
He looked unfamiliar,
so I took a closer look.

84
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,398
Anyone trusted to handle

85
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:12,399
his master's dirty work

86
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:14,318
must have some standing

87
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:15,919
and money to spare.

88
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,000
Check the taverns
and teahouses he frequents

89
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:19,638
and find out everything about him.

90
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,599
Yes.

91
00:06:21,199 --> 00:06:22,320
Scholar Han,

92
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:23,359
please go back

93
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,559
and tell Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

94
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:25,719
that we have a lead.

95
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,360
I'll let them know
as soon as I have news.

96
00:06:28,759 --> 00:06:29,880
Scholar Han,

97
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,120
please.

98
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,039
Uncle Liu...

99
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,240
There's something else

100
00:06:39,576 --> 00:06:41,270
I'd like to discuss with him in private.

101
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,159
Scholar Han,

102
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,120
you should go home.

103
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:59,000
I'll take my leave.

104
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:14,000
When you changed clothes

105
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:16,240
and disguised yourself as a playwright,

106
00:07:16,879 --> 00:07:18,959
I noticed that the index finger
on your left hand

107
00:07:19,519 --> 00:07:20,759
was missing a section.

108
00:07:31,079 --> 00:07:32,240
When I was young,

109
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,639
I made a living selling firewood.

110
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:37,399
While cutting wood in the mountains,

111
00:07:41,439 --> 00:07:43,599
I accidentally chopped off
part of my finger.

112
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:48,560
How did you end up

113
00:07:48,632 --> 00:07:50,190
working as a laborer with the troupe?

114
00:07:51,959 --> 00:07:54,000
When I delivered firewood to Mister Lu,

115
00:07:54,959 --> 00:07:56,120
Mister Lu

116
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:58,360
saw how hard it was for me
to make a living

117
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,000
and found me work with the troupe,

118
00:08:02,040 --> 00:08:03,599
so I could make a living.

119
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:10,759
Zhao Xuede is close to Prince Han.

120
00:08:11,176 --> 00:08:13,830
He must be helping Prince Han
search for something he lost.

121
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,320
As it happens,

122
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:19,159
the Crown Prince has also lost something

123
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,120
and is searching everywhere for it.

124
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,040
Today,

125
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,759
they can surround the troupe.

126
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:27,959
Tomorrow,

127
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:31,440
they could surround all of Jinling City.

128
00:08:43,639 --> 00:08:45,400
I'll put you on a ship

129
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,040
and get you out of Jinling.

130
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,798
I've heard that overseas,

131
00:08:55,799 --> 00:08:57,839
there are also
communities of our people.

132
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,160
In a new place,

133
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:03,199
perhaps you can put
your skills to good use

134
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,599
and live the life you want,

135
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:08,160
instead of hiding away in one corner

136
00:09:08,679 --> 00:09:10,199
just trying to survive.

137
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,079
Why?

138
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:15,320
First, you've committed no crime.

139
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:17,760
Second,

140
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:21,680
I don't want Mister Lu and Furong

141
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:24,239
to pay with their lives

142
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:26,400
for an act of kindness.

143
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,560
Too much innocent blood

144
00:09:32,039 --> 00:09:34,719
has already
been spilled in Jinling City.

145
00:09:35,500 --> 00:09:43,340
♪With my own hands and heart,
I write my name♪

146
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:50,619
♪Through countless lines of ink,
step by step toward the light♪

147
00:09:50,620 --> 00:09:57,079
♪With what I know and do,
I rewrite my fate♪

148
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,199
I'll leave.

149
00:09:58,300 --> 00:10:09,780
♪As the long night ends,
I no longer question the past♪

150
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,879
Uncle Xu.

151
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:38,839
Go inside and lie down for a while.

152
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,398
Once we hear from Commander Lin,

153
00:10:41,399 --> 00:10:42,999
you'll need your strength to help.

154
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,560
Is this the Xu residence?

155
00:11:06,904 --> 00:11:08,216
I'm Tao, an official matchmaker.

156
00:11:08,248 --> 00:11:10,550
The Han family asked me
to come and propose marriage.

157
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:11,352
Madam Tao!

158
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,758
Mother, someone's here to see you.

159
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:13,560
Madam Han.

160
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,920
Madam Han!

161
00:11:18,039 --> 00:11:19,518
What's going on, Madam Han?

162
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,719
Let's talk outside.

163
00:11:21,016 --> 00:11:21,912
Madam Han, weren't you

164
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:24,630
the one who asked me to come
propose marriage to the Xu family?

165
00:11:24,639 --> 00:11:26,119
I came rushing over here,

166
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,040
so why are you pushing me out?

167
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:29,959
Even if you've changed your mind,

168
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,599
you should've told me beforehand.

169
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,038
I'm sorry.

170
00:11:33,039 --> 00:11:34,839
So much has happened these past few days

171
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,040
that I completely forgot to tell you.

172
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,199
Madam Tao,

173
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:40,040
our family hasn't changed its mind.

174
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,199
It's just not a good day
to propose marriage.

175
00:11:43,039 --> 00:11:45,680
I'm sorry you came
all this way for nothing.

176
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,158
Scholar Han, don't worry.

177
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,798
As for you and the Xu family's daughter,

178
00:11:49,799 --> 00:11:51,079
leave it to me.

179
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,640
Take care, Madam Tao.

180
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:54,239
I'll be going, Madam Han.

181
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,359
Goodbye.

182
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:58,040
Two coins for doing nothing.

183
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:15,320
How long has Commander Lin been here?

184
00:12:16,279 --> 00:12:17,320
I just arrived.

185
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:19,839
Mother,

186
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:21,599
go make dinner first.

187
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:35,918
Do you have any leads?

188
00:12:35,919 --> 00:12:36,599
We've identified

189
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,440
the man who posed as a laborer.

190
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:39,800
However,

191
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,440
someone silenced him for good.

192
00:12:41,519 --> 00:12:42,719
He's dead?

193
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,640
This is Jinling City.

194
00:12:44,799 --> 00:12:45,918
Who could possibly

195
00:12:45,919 --> 00:12:47,079
disregard the law

196
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,560
and kill as if it were nothing?

197
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:54,160
Someone neither of us
can afford to cross right now.

198
00:12:54,616 --> 00:12:56,830
Knowing who it is would only
cause you more worry.

199
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:01,839
This all started because of me.

200
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:03,599
I was careless

201
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,040
and dragged Lanxiang into this.

202
00:13:05,879 --> 00:13:07,320
I'm too ashamed to go inside.

203
00:13:07,759 --> 00:13:09,560
Please tell Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

204
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:12,038
that I will bring Lanxiang back

205
00:13:12,039 --> 00:13:13,719
and apologize to them in person.

206
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:17,040
Where exactly is Lanxiang?

207
00:13:19,039 --> 00:13:21,359
All we know so far is that
she was taken out of Jinling.

208
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:23,359
The trail goes cold after that.

209
00:13:24,279 --> 00:13:25,760
She's no longer in Jinling?

210
00:13:27,540 --> 00:13:32,420
(Yangzhou City)

211
00:13:43,100 --> 00:13:45,899
(Qingyan House)

212
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:49,500
(Intoxicated Moon in the Mist)

213
00:14:25,320 --> 00:14:27,678
(Xiaopu)
She says she's feeling unwell

214
00:14:27,679 --> 00:14:29,800
and doesn't want
to see any guests today.

215
00:14:34,039 --> 00:14:37,760
She's unwell ten days
out of every month.

216
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,638
She finally gets a customer

217
00:14:39,639 --> 00:14:41,479
and still gives him an attitude.

218
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:43,158
(Liu Yueniang, Owner of Qingyan House)

219
00:14:43,159 --> 00:14:44,320
Fine.

220
00:14:44,639 --> 00:14:46,440
She's our star courtesan, after all.

221
00:14:46,799 --> 00:14:49,599
We all have to indulge her a little.

222
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:01,900
(Zhi)

223
00:15:10,279 --> 00:15:11,599
Behave yourself.

224
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,320
Trying to escape?

225
00:15:20,679 --> 00:15:22,038
If it were that easy

226
00:15:22,039 --> 00:15:24,199
to escape from me,

227
00:15:24,399 --> 00:15:26,638
then I, Liu Yueniang,
would've lived over forty years

228
00:15:26,639 --> 00:15:28,599
for nothing.

229
00:15:30,799 --> 00:15:32,239
I was tricked into coming here.

230
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,199
Please...

231
00:15:34,679 --> 00:15:35,920
Please...

232
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:39,560
Lift your head.

233
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:40,560
Don't move.

234
00:15:46,240 --> 00:15:47,359
Girl,

235
00:15:48,799 --> 00:15:51,999
I don't care whether
your parents sold you here

236
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:54,560
or traffickers tricked you
into coming here.

237
00:15:55,039 --> 00:15:57,920
Once you enter my Qingyan House,

238
00:15:58,639 --> 00:16:02,038
even if you were once a princess
or a prince's consort,

239
00:16:02,039 --> 00:16:04,400
you'll still have to serve customers.

240
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,599
Not bad.

241
00:16:18,799 --> 00:16:20,640
You've got a pretty face.

242
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,199
Change her clothes
and put some makeup on her.

243
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:25,760
The customer is still waiting.

244
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:27,079
All right.

245
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:31,640
Are you crazy?

246
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,599
You...

247
00:16:44,960 --> 00:16:47,079
You think doing this

248
00:16:47,399 --> 00:16:49,239
means you won't have to serve customers?

249
00:16:50,200 --> 00:16:51,999
Silly girl.

250
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,839
Let me tell you,

251
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:56,959
plenty of men like this sort of thing.

252
00:17:00,039 --> 00:17:02,920
If she doesn't even care about herself,

253
00:17:03,039 --> 00:17:05,240
I won't waste my effort, either.

254
00:17:05,519 --> 00:17:06,758
Gag her.

255
00:17:06,759 --> 00:17:08,558
Just send her over like this.

256
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,760
Understood.

257
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,359
Hold her down.

258
00:17:11,599 --> 00:17:13,399
No!

259
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,919
Open your mouth.

260
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:38,078
I don't know
why she's putting up such a fight.

261
00:17:38,079 --> 00:17:40,719
Once I get my hands on you,

262
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,879
even if you die,

263
00:17:43,119 --> 00:17:46,760
I'll still squeeze every last bit
of profit from your bones.

264
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:15,040
Your face is quite pretty.

265
00:18:17,519 --> 00:18:18,720
But these hands...

266
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:22,520
Madam, my hands may be rough,

267
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:25,159
but I can play music, chess,
write calligraphy, and paint.

268
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,960
I can also perform opera.

269
00:18:29,119 --> 00:18:30,439
With hands like these,

270
00:18:31,319 --> 00:18:33,159
you claim you can do all four arts?

271
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,399
Who are you trying to fool?

272
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:46,040
May I borrow the fan
at your waist, Madam?

273
00:19:50,119 --> 00:19:52,720
I really misjudged you.

274
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,079
Madam,

275
00:19:56,119 --> 00:19:58,118
if you're too eager to make a sale,

276
00:19:58,119 --> 00:20:01,040
even the finest goods
won't fetch a good price.

277
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:04,399
Why not build up some interest first?

278
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,280
Make it something rare and sought after,

279
00:20:06,319 --> 00:20:08,119
and then wait for the highest offer.

280
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:22,399
You're a clever one.

281
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:25,040
But in our line of work,

282
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:28,040
a pretty face alone isn't enough.

283
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,599
You

284
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:33,040
have to be shrewder than men

285
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:35,358
if you want to get

286
00:20:35,359 --> 00:20:37,200
all their money out of them.

287
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:43,239
You're just pretending to play along

288
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:45,919
so you can stall for time
and escape, aren't you?

289
00:20:51,279 --> 00:20:53,560
But you were right about one thing.

290
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:59,280
You won't get a good price
if you're too eager to sell.

291
00:21:00,119 --> 00:21:02,560
We'll spend a day preparing properly

292
00:21:03,079 --> 00:21:05,518
and invite all
the wealthy men in Yangzhou

293
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:07,359
to come here.

294
00:21:07,400 --> 00:21:10,518
Whoever comes out on top

295
00:21:10,519 --> 00:21:12,359
will become

296
00:21:14,119 --> 00:21:15,480
our Liu Qing...

297
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:19,960
Young Lady Liu Qing's very first patron.

298
00:21:21,759 --> 00:21:24,639
I won't disappoint you, Madam.

299
00:21:27,640 --> 00:21:30,480
Tomorrow will be your big day.

300
00:21:31,079 --> 00:21:32,999
I won't give you any chance

301
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:35,240
to disappoint me.

302
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:53,639
There's news.

303
00:21:53,640 --> 00:21:54,439
Sit.

304
00:21:54,728 --> 00:21:56,184
The clues you gave me were limited.

305
00:21:56,232 --> 00:21:58,270
Luckily, I've been keeping
an eye on Duke Xianguo.

306
00:21:58,270 --> 00:22:00,220
As it happens,
I managed to find a lead for you.

307
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:02,479
Last night, there was indeed
a suspicious vessel

308
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,480
that left Jinling for Yangzhou.

309
00:22:04,960 --> 00:22:06,439
I've sent men after it.

310
00:22:06,440 --> 00:22:08,038
As long as Young Lady Xu is in Yangzhou,

311
00:22:08,039 --> 00:22:09,879
we'll have news
within two or three days.

312
00:22:11,720 --> 00:22:13,040
I want to go to Yangzhou.

313
00:22:13,400 --> 00:22:15,800
Young Lady Xu was struck
by this misfortune because of me.

314
00:22:16,079 --> 00:22:17,800
I have to bring her back.

315
00:22:24,519 --> 00:22:26,760
His Majesty's health is getting worse.

316
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,000
Things

317
00:22:28,079 --> 00:22:29,280
may be about to change.

318
00:22:31,519 --> 00:22:33,399
But the Crown Prince is still in Jinling.

319
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:35,630
Won't His Majesty
summon him back to the capital?

320
00:22:36,552 --> 00:22:39,070
I don't know whether
no imperial decree was ever issued

321
00:22:39,079 --> 00:22:41,439
or it simply can't reach Jinling.

322
00:22:42,088 --> 00:22:44,120
The Crown Prince
is extremely anxious right now.

323
00:22:44,248 --> 00:22:46,410
But returning to the capital
without an imperial decree

324
00:22:46,424 --> 00:22:47,670
would amount to treason.

325
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:51,558
Besides, Zheng Baichuan
is close to Prince Han.

326
00:22:51,559 --> 00:22:52,919
Without an imperial decree,

327
00:22:52,960 --> 00:22:55,359
Zheng Baichuan will never
let the Crown Prince leave the city.

328
00:22:56,319 --> 00:22:58,359
Zheng Baichuan is only
the Joint Defense Commander.

329
00:22:58,360 --> 00:22:59,550
The Central Military Command's

330
00:22:59,559 --> 00:23:01,500
Commander, Duke Xiangguo,
is the Defense Commander.

331
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:02,910
As long as Duke Xiangguo is willing,

332
00:23:03,160 --> 00:23:05,119
the gates of Jinling
cannot remain sealed.

333
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,999
Prince Han and the Crown Prince

334
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,079
are both Duke Xiangguo's
biological nephews.

335
00:23:09,240 --> 00:23:10,959
Whichever of them ascends the throne,

336
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:13,320
Duke Xiangguo will be
the Emperor's maternal uncle.

337
00:23:15,384 --> 00:23:17,030
He has always remained on the sidelines,

338
00:23:17,039 --> 00:23:18,399
supporting neither side.

339
00:23:18,440 --> 00:23:19,720
But in Jinling now,

340
00:23:20,559 --> 00:23:23,359
Joint Defense Commander,
Zheng Baichuan calls the shots.

341
00:23:27,079 --> 00:23:28,079
Yuan,

342
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:31,639
Zheng Baichuan is ruthless
and utterly without principle.

343
00:23:31,944 --> 00:23:33,656
He betrayed
the deposed Emperor back then

344
00:23:33,700 --> 00:23:36,230
and offered Jinling City
to His Majesty to prove his allegiance.

345
00:23:36,248 --> 00:23:38,590
Now he could just as easily
offer the Crown Prince's head

346
00:23:38,640 --> 00:23:40,240
to Prince Han to prove his allegiance.

347
00:23:47,559 --> 00:23:49,079
Forgive my bold words,

348
00:23:49,319 --> 00:23:50,839
but every word comes from the heart.

349
00:24:08,039 --> 00:24:09,439
You're right to remind me.

350
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:11,959
With or without an imperial decree,

351
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:13,719
Prince Han will never
let the Crown Prince

352
00:24:13,720 --> 00:24:15,320
leave Jinling alive.

353
00:24:18,079 --> 00:24:20,040
The Crown Prince's life is in danger.

354
00:24:20,424 --> 00:24:23,288
If he is to have any chance of survival,
he must return to the capital.

355
00:24:24,776 --> 00:24:26,350
But the Naval Camp is outside the city.

356
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:27,639
There's nothing I can do.

357
00:24:31,279 --> 00:24:32,439
Fengtai,

358
00:24:32,839 --> 00:24:35,800
you're the only one
with troops inside the city right now.

359
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:40,040
Please help the Crown Prince
leave Jinling.

360
00:24:45,960 --> 00:24:47,399
My forces are limited.

361
00:24:48,000 --> 00:24:49,960
I can't confront Zheng Baichuan head-on.

362
00:24:50,119 --> 00:24:52,479
However, if we can create
a diversion in plain sight

363
00:24:52,480 --> 00:24:54,050
while secretly taking another route,

364
00:24:54,079 --> 00:24:55,159
I'm confident

365
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:57,280
I can escort the Crown Prince
safely out of the city.

366
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:03,239
Secretly taking another route...

367
00:25:03,240 --> 00:25:04,480
I understand.

368
00:25:04,920 --> 00:25:07,040
But how do we create the diversion?

369
00:25:09,279 --> 00:25:11,118
I went to the troupe today

370
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,480
and came up with an idea.

371
00:25:12,568 --> 00:25:14,270
You're getting married on the sixth.

372
00:25:14,279 --> 00:25:16,879
The Crown Prince and Zheng Baichuan
will both attend.

373
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,919
Hire the best troupe in all of Jinling

374
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,720
and have them
put on a grand performance.

375
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,118
That won't be difficult.

376
00:25:23,119 --> 00:25:24,719
The Crown Prince enjoys opera.

377
00:25:24,720 --> 00:25:25,880
It would be perfectly natural

378
00:25:25,912 --> 00:25:27,830
for me to arrange
a troupe to perform for him.

379
00:25:28,616 --> 00:25:30,008
Then prepare well for your wedding.

380
00:25:30,056 --> 00:25:31,460
I'll make a trip to Yangzhou first.

381
00:25:31,519 --> 00:25:32,800
Are you out of your mind?

382
00:25:33,319 --> 00:25:34,838
At a time when lives are at stake,

383
00:25:34,839 --> 00:25:36,598
you're still going
to Yangzhou for a woman?

384
00:25:36,600 --> 00:25:37,416
Let me ask you this.

385
00:25:37,432 --> 00:25:39,510
If the Crown Prince
is to return safely to the capital,

386
00:25:39,519 --> 00:25:41,320
should he travel overland or by water?

387
00:25:47,380 --> 00:25:48,660
(Canal Transport Map)

388
00:25:56,660 --> 00:25:59,620
(Jinling, Yangzhou)

389
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:03,520
In that case, for both
official and personal reasons,

390
00:26:03,680 --> 00:26:05,480
you need to make a trip to Yangzhou.

391
00:26:07,559 --> 00:26:10,040
Now you have the search
for Young Lady Xu as a reason to go,

392
00:26:10,050 --> 00:26:11,879
so Zheng Baichuan won't
be suspicious either.

393
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:14,240
As soon as the city gates open tomorrow,

394
00:26:14,519 --> 00:26:16,040
I'll set out for Yangzhou.

395
00:26:16,580 --> 00:26:20,180
(Longjiang Pass Wharf)

396
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:21,919
Sirs,

397
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:23,119
please board.

398
00:26:42,480 --> 00:26:43,200
Boatman.

399
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:44,679
Boatman.

400
00:26:48,480 --> 00:26:49,439
Boatman.

401
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:51,199
Are you going to Yangzhou?

402
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:52,679
We're going to Yangzhou, too.

403
00:26:53,519 --> 00:26:54,639
Scholar Han?

404
00:27:02,279 --> 00:27:03,399
I'm sorry.

405
00:27:03,448 --> 00:27:06,150
These two examination candidates
want to enjoy the scenery and paint,

406
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:08,250
so they've chartered
the entire boat. You'll have to

407
00:27:08,260 --> 00:27:10,040
find another boat.

408
00:27:11,079 --> 00:27:12,200
Sorry to trouble you.

409
00:27:24,160 --> 00:27:25,760
Uncle Liu from the Furong Troupe

410
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:28,000
got drunk, fell into
the water, and drowned.

411
00:27:28,359 --> 00:27:29,598
By now, his body

412
00:27:29,600 --> 00:27:31,304
should have been recovered

413
00:27:31,352 --> 00:27:33,200
by men from
the Western City Patrol Office.

414
00:27:39,559 --> 00:27:40,520
Set sail.

415
00:27:51,580 --> 00:27:53,900
(Qingyan House)

416
00:28:20,039 --> 00:28:21,679
Young Lady Liu Qing,

417
00:28:22,519 --> 00:28:25,879
even if you manage to shake us two off,

418
00:28:25,920 --> 00:28:28,584
there are two more guarding
the window below.

419
00:28:28,696 --> 00:28:30,320
And that's not counting those upstairs.

420
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:32,078
There are four more

421
00:28:32,079 --> 00:28:35,280
on the stairs and outside
the main entrance.

422
00:28:37,559 --> 00:28:38,599
You

423
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,439
can't escape.

424
00:28:44,519 --> 00:28:46,919
Gold! It's gold!

425
00:28:50,079 --> 00:28:52,040
I'm determined to have her.

426
00:29:00,079 --> 00:29:01,999
Congratulations, Young Master Wang.

427
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:05,078
You'll be Young Lady Liu Qing's
first patron today.

428
00:29:05,079 --> 00:29:07,320
- Good!
- Good!

429
00:29:07,359 --> 00:29:08,480
Congratulations!

430
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:10,720
Exactly.

431
00:29:11,319 --> 00:29:13,119
I'm just nervous.

432
00:29:13,160 --> 00:29:14,439
I'm just looking around

433
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,439
and getting some air.

434
00:29:16,759 --> 00:29:18,359
You're too kind.

435
00:29:19,079 --> 00:29:21,798
I'll take you upstairs
to see Young Lady Liu Qing right now.

436
00:29:21,799 --> 00:29:22,599
Good.

437
00:29:22,640 --> 00:29:23,439
Good.

438
00:29:46,200 --> 00:29:48,038
Isn't this Young Lady Shuang?

439
00:29:48,039 --> 00:29:50,399
What brings you here?

440
00:29:51,480 --> 00:29:53,879
I came to see Madam's new favorite

441
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,839
and find out what she looks like.

442
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,000
Both of you, leave us.

443
00:29:58,319 --> 00:30:00,278
I have a few private words

444
00:30:00,279 --> 00:30:02,159
to say to this young lady.

445
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,639
Well...

446
00:30:04,119 --> 00:30:05,599
I'm afraid we can't do that.

447
00:30:05,720 --> 00:30:07,919
Madam Liu specifically told us

448
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:10,078
that we must never leave
Young Lady Liu Qing

449
00:30:10,079 --> 00:30:11,719
alone.

450
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,760
How is she alone?

451
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:16,320
Xiaopu and I are both here.

452
00:30:16,359 --> 00:30:17,599
Well...

453
00:30:24,079 --> 00:30:25,240
What?

454
00:30:25,519 --> 00:30:27,119
Now that there's someone new,

455
00:30:27,359 --> 00:30:29,079
my word means nothing?

456
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:41,320
I haven't lost my looks yet,

457
00:30:41,960 --> 00:30:43,760
but I can't even

458
00:30:44,799 --> 00:30:46,520
give orders to you two anymore?

459
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,960
Well...

460
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:53,240
I'm in a hurry to meet Master Wei.

461
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:54,800
I'll only say a few words.

462
00:31:04,279 --> 00:31:05,320
Well...

463
00:31:06,160 --> 00:31:09,079
Fine. Let's go. Come on.

464
00:31:20,599 --> 00:31:21,919
We'll change clothes.

465
00:31:22,000 --> 00:31:23,278
Xiaopu will take you out.

466
00:31:23,279 --> 00:31:24,399
Ji'er?

467
00:31:24,839 --> 00:31:26,159
Why is it you?

468
00:31:26,799 --> 00:31:27,879
Enough talk. Come.

469
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:28,480
Sit.

470
00:31:33,079 --> 00:31:34,078
Back then,

471
00:31:34,079 --> 00:31:35,518
I was such a fool.

472
00:31:35,519 --> 00:31:36,679
I couldn't tell good from bad.

473
00:31:36,920 --> 00:31:38,720
You warned me time and again,

474
00:31:38,839 --> 00:31:39,919
but I ignored you

475
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,359
and never listened.

476
00:31:43,359 --> 00:31:45,560
The only reason I survived

477
00:31:45,880 --> 00:31:47,079
that vicious Zhao Xingtang

478
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:49,040
was because of your warnings.

479
00:31:49,799 --> 00:31:50,760
Now,

480
00:31:51,359 --> 00:31:53,079
consider this my way of repaying you.

481
00:31:59,599 --> 00:32:01,359
What will happen to you after I leave?

482
00:32:04,839 --> 00:32:06,320
Don't worry.

483
00:32:07,240 --> 00:32:08,800
As long as I still have this face,

484
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,439
and as long as those men

485
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,879
still want to sleep with me,

486
00:32:12,880 --> 00:32:15,200
Madam Liu won't dare do much to me.

487
00:32:15,279 --> 00:32:17,159
At worst,

488
00:32:17,519 --> 00:32:18,919
she'll make me take more customers

489
00:32:19,160 --> 00:32:20,560
and earn more money for her.

490
00:32:27,464 --> 00:32:29,464
I've been in this brothel
for almost two years.

491
00:32:29,544 --> 00:32:32,000
Don't tell me you still think
I'm an innocent young woman.

492
00:32:36,079 --> 00:32:37,118
Come.

493
00:32:37,119 --> 00:32:38,320
Hurry and change.

494
00:32:42,039 --> 00:32:42,960
Take it off.

495
00:32:44,519 --> 00:32:45,599
Come, turn around.

496
00:32:54,079 --> 00:32:55,720
This is as far as I can help you.

497
00:32:56,279 --> 00:32:57,399
You

498
00:32:57,440 --> 00:32:59,199
must escape from Yangzhou

499
00:32:59,200 --> 00:33:00,480
and get back to Jinling.

500
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,599
Don't let all my efforts go to waste.

501
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:08,399
Ji'er,

502
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:11,200
wait for me.

503
00:33:11,400 --> 00:33:13,359
I'll come back and buy your freedom.

504
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:29,520
I promise I'll get you out.

505
00:33:35,559 --> 00:33:36,520
All right.

506
00:33:37,599 --> 00:33:38,679
I'll wait for you.

507
00:33:39,020 --> 00:33:41,980
♪A lone figure
wanders down the old lane♪

508
00:33:42,180 --> 00:33:44,479
♪The heart remembers
what time cannot erase♪

509
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:45,912
I'll wait for you to come save me.

510
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:50,260
♪One thought brings sorrow,
another dreams of brighter days♪

511
00:33:56,119 --> 00:33:57,798
I'll keep your secret if you want,

512
00:33:57,799 --> 00:33:58,839
but

513
00:33:59,079 --> 00:34:01,079
you'll have to listen to me from now on.

514
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:02,760
You mean it?

515
00:34:02,960 --> 00:34:05,358
When I give my word, I mean it.

516
00:34:05,359 --> 00:34:06,760
I always keep my word.

517
00:34:07,400 --> 00:34:08,598
You were too scared to sleep,

518
00:34:08,599 --> 00:34:09,839
so don't blame me.

519
00:34:12,280 --> 00:34:14,198
You're getting more foolish by the day.

520
00:34:14,199 --> 00:34:16,959
Young Master gave me this money.

521
00:34:18,719 --> 00:34:19,678
Eat it secretly.

522
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:21,240
Don't let those two see it.

523
00:34:25,940 --> 00:34:29,220
♪Step by step, page by page♪

524
00:34:29,300 --> 00:34:32,180
♪The portrait of my youth takes shape♪

525
00:34:32,340 --> 00:34:38,459
♪Let every doubt and restless
turn be carried on the wind♪

526
00:34:38,460 --> 00:34:41,539
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

527
00:34:41,540 --> 00:34:44,459
♪I watch the bustling world come and go♪

528
00:34:44,460 --> 00:34:51,020
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

529
00:35:04,760 --> 00:35:05,760
Xiaopu,

530
00:35:05,864 --> 00:35:07,150
hurry and take your mistress out.

531
00:35:07,159 --> 00:35:09,380
♪And around weathered corridors♪

532
00:35:09,860 --> 00:35:14,780
♪One moment of peace
brings a little brightness♪

533
00:35:15,199 --> 00:35:16,320
Young Lady,

534
00:35:16,599 --> 00:35:18,399
Master Wei is still waiting.

535
00:35:19,079 --> 00:35:19,879
Let's go.

536
00:35:19,880 --> 00:35:22,180
♪Nor chase
the changing tides of the world♪

537
00:35:24,679 --> 00:35:26,399
I only said a few words.

538
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,919
Why are you so upset?

539
00:35:27,920 --> 00:35:29,160
Is that really necessary?

540
00:35:32,079 --> 00:35:34,359
We have plenty of time ahead of us.

541
00:35:36,719 --> 00:35:38,280
We'll see about that.

542
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,198
Wait for me.

543
00:35:42,199 --> 00:35:44,420
♪Chapter by chapter, journey by journey♪

544
00:35:45,280 --> 00:35:45,999
Take care.

545
00:35:47,260 --> 00:35:53,260
♪And quietly wait for the light♪

546
00:36:13,039 --> 00:36:14,919
Leaving already, Young Lady Shuang?

547
00:36:15,112 --> 00:36:16,870
Be careful not
to bring yourself bad luck.

548
00:36:18,079 --> 00:36:18,999
Understood.

549
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:21,039
Take care, Young Lady Shuang.

550
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:29,078
She's asleep.

551
00:36:29,079 --> 00:36:30,280
It's all right.

552
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:43,280
Young Master Wang,

553
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:44,879
take it slowly.

554
00:36:44,920 --> 00:36:46,479
Watch your step.

555
00:36:47,280 --> 00:36:48,399
All right.

556
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:57,080
Shuang.

557
00:36:57,599 --> 00:36:59,519
Going to see Master Wei?

558
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:11,158
It's certainly lively downstairs today.

559
00:37:11,159 --> 00:37:13,680
Hearing all that
has put her in a foul mood.

560
00:37:23,079 --> 00:37:24,879
That little wretch.

561
00:37:25,199 --> 00:37:27,959
You'll have plenty more
to be upset about.

562
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:41,160
Young Master Wang,

563
00:37:41,840 --> 00:37:44,399
Young Lady Liu Qing is inside.

564
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:46,479
I'll leave you two alone.

565
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:56,439
Young Lady Liu Qing,

566
00:37:56,599 --> 00:37:58,080
I'm here.

567
00:37:58,679 --> 00:38:01,160
Sir, I'm shy.

568
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:02,999
Turn off the light.

569
00:38:03,199 --> 00:38:04,800
All right.

570
00:38:21,760 --> 00:38:22,839
Shuang!

571
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:24,479
Someone!

572
00:38:24,800 --> 00:38:25,839
Liu Yueniang!

573
00:38:26,960 --> 00:38:28,080
Liu Yueniang!

574
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:31,030
How dare you pass her off
as an untouched maiden

575
00:38:31,039 --> 00:38:32,160
and cheat me out of my money?

576
00:38:32,679 --> 00:38:33,640
Out of my way!

577
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:35,439
- Young Master Wang!
- What...

578
00:38:35,519 --> 00:38:36,680
Quickly!

579
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:52,999
Liu Qing has escaped!

580
00:38:53,119 --> 00:38:54,559
All of you, go after her!

581
00:38:55,119 --> 00:38:55,558
Yes!

582
00:38:55,559 --> 00:38:57,320
She can't have gone far.

583
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:59,359
You must bring her back!

584
00:38:59,360 --> 00:39:00,359
- After her!
- Yes!

585
00:39:03,992 --> 00:39:05,510
(Yangzhou Watergate Wharf)

586
00:39:05,528 --> 00:39:07,270
Anyone else taking the large boat?

587
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:08,919
Hurry aboard the ferry!

588
00:39:17,239 --> 00:39:18,919
Once he's aboard my boat,

589
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:20,959
(Luo Dalang)
unless Heaven itself comes for him,

590
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:23,720
(Leader of the Boatmen's Guild)
no one else can get him off my boat.

591
00:39:24,199 --> 00:39:25,800
With him in your hands,

592
00:39:26,480 --> 00:39:27,839
I can rest easy.

593
00:39:43,760 --> 00:39:44,760
Lin,

594
00:39:46,280 --> 00:39:48,039
you came to Yangzhou this time

595
00:39:48,159 --> 00:39:50,279
to ask me to help you find a woman.

596
00:39:50,280 --> 00:39:51,200
Anything else,

597
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:52,999
I know nothing about.

598
00:39:55,880 --> 00:39:57,039
There's one more thing

599
00:39:57,559 --> 00:39:59,039
I need your help with.

600
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,879
I can already tell it's risky.

601
00:40:04,320 --> 00:40:05,760
There is some risk,

602
00:40:06,159 --> 00:40:07,600
but the credit will be great, too.

603
00:40:09,960 --> 00:40:11,039
Young Master.

604
00:40:14,599 --> 00:40:15,600
Where is she?

605
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,600
Qingyan House.

606
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:24,800
Nanke has already gone ahead.

607
00:40:30,100 --> 00:40:34,940
(Zhenhuai Gate)

608
00:40:57,559 --> 00:40:58,600
Hurry!

609
00:40:58,920 --> 00:41:00,120
Search carefully.

610
00:41:05,032 --> 00:41:06,800
There's no way
she could've left the city.

611
00:41:07,039 --> 00:41:08,800
Stop following me. Go look over there!

612
00:41:36,159 --> 00:41:38,039
There's no way
she could've left the city.

613
00:41:47,448 --> 00:41:48,910
Where did this chicken come from?

614
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,240
Help me catch my chicken!

615
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:54,238
Where did all these chickens come from?

616
00:41:54,239 --> 00:41:55,359
Move!

617
00:41:57,480 --> 00:41:58,799
What's going on over there?

618
00:41:58,800 --> 00:41:59,680
No idea.

619
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:05,559
Sir,

620
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:08,120
you work so hard every day.

621
00:42:09,360 --> 00:42:11,999
Have you seen a young lady today

622
00:42:12,000 --> 00:42:13,439
traveling alone,

623
00:42:13,440 --> 00:42:14,919
about this tall?

624
00:42:15,159 --> 00:42:15,638
No.

625
00:42:15,639 --> 00:42:16,760
Grandma, slow down.

626
00:42:17,280 --> 00:42:18,280
Thank you.

627
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:21,439
All right.

628
00:42:22,159 --> 00:42:23,280
Keep looking.

629
00:42:23,840 --> 00:42:25,559
Hurry.

630
00:42:46,460 --> 00:42:48,260
(Zhenhuai Gate)

631
00:43:05,180 --> 00:43:07,660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

632
00:43:08,719 --> 00:43:10,839
If you had nothing to hide,

633
00:43:12,760 --> 00:43:15,039
why would you be afraid
of me pretending to be a ghost?

634
00:43:17,599 --> 00:43:20,399
There's another old
saying that's even better.

635
00:43:20,519 --> 00:43:23,039
Money can make
even a ghost turn a millstone.

636
00:43:23,920 --> 00:43:25,759
I have wealth and power.

637
00:43:25,760 --> 00:43:27,640
I can catch and destroy ghosts,

638
00:43:27,719 --> 00:43:29,559
and even make
them turn millstones for me.

639
00:43:30,239 --> 00:43:31,519
But you...

640
00:43:36,239 --> 00:43:38,160
can only be a ghost.

641
00:43:56,300 --> 00:44:00,420
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

642
00:44:03,260 --> 00:44:07,780
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

643
00:44:09,060 --> 00:44:12,980
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

644
00:44:13,660 --> 00:44:16,420
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

645
00:44:17,140 --> 00:44:19,460
♪Though all the world may fade♪

646
00:44:19,460 --> 00:44:22,540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

647
00:44:24,060 --> 00:44:28,300
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

648
00:44:31,220 --> 00:44:35,380
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

649
00:44:37,180 --> 00:44:40,740
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

650
00:44:40,740 --> 00:44:44,300
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

651
00:44:45,100 --> 00:44:50,780
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

652
00:44:51,140 --> 00:44:55,460
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

653
00:44:55,820 --> 00:44:58,780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

654
00:44:58,780 --> 00:45:02,540
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

655
00:45:02,540 --> 00:45:05,420
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

656
00:45:05,420 --> 00:45:09,500
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

657
00:45:09,500 --> 00:45:12,860
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

658
00:45:12,860 --> 00:45:16,620
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

659
00:45:16,620 --> 00:45:20,620
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

660
00:45:21,380 --> 00:45:25,540
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

661
00:45:25,540 --> 00:45:28,980
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

662
00:45:28,980 --> 00:45:32,620
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

663
00:45:32,620 --> 00:45:35,500
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

664
00:45:35,500 --> 00:45:39,580
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

665
00:45:39,580 --> 00:45:42,940
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

666
00:45:42,940 --> 00:45:46,580
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

667
00:45:46,580 --> 00:45:54,380
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
